{"t":"Mana Leech","s":"mana-leech-94283","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Mana Leech</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.94<br/>May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<b>Mana leech</b>, introduced with Updates/10.94, is a way to receive mana from your opponent during fighting. It can be done by <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a> certain equipment with <a href=\"#/wiki/Powerful%20Void\">Powerful Void</a>, by enhancing skills through the Wheel of Destiny, or wearing equipment that has Augments that provide mana leech.\n<p>It is worth noting that <a href=\"#/wiki/Prey%20System\">Damage Preys</a> do not affect the leech. Details on how it works can be found under the formulae page.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It was initially available via Charging, but this was removed with Updates/11.40.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p>Critical Hits, <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Leech\">Life Leech</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a></p></div></div>","quests":["the-lightbearer"]}